      "content": "\"Empty\" is often just the truth you've been avoiding—a sign that you've been pouring from a dry well, not a lack of talent. The noise you see is the residue of a voice that's exhausted itself, and silence is the only honest reset. You haven't run out of things to give; you've run out of reasons to keep giving the same hollow way. So stop fighting the quiet—let it swallow you whole, and see what it feels like to be nothing for a while. That's the only place where the real answer waits.",
